  "description": "Model Lee Hwi-Hyun is a sadly impotent virgin. One day, he meets famous photographer Jeong Mi-Eul. Her first impression is of a calm and collected person, but as soon as the shoot begins, she transforms, overwhelming Lee Hwi-Hyun like a predator hunting its prey. Perhaps due to Jeong Mi-Eul's fiery gaze enveloping his entire body, Hwi-Hyun begins to feel a growing heat within him. Jeong Mi-Eul, who has always been aroused by the camera lens, also continues to shoot in a state of intense excitement...\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
